      "text": "Either mode, no ack within rpl_semi_sync_source_timeout = 10000 ms:\nswitch_off() -> wake all waiters -> commitTrx() returns 0 -> client gets a normal OK.\nThe primary is now async. The only sign is Rpl_semi_sync_source_no_tx going up.",
